tions</strong> (built on craters to draw colored power), <strong>Cables</strong> (link Towers to Power Stations), <strong>Splitters</strong> (divide a cable\u2019s power), and <strong>Scaffolding</strong> (lets cables cross other cables or span mountains).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1761745260\" width=18 height=16 /></span> <strong>Real-time</strong> growing colony <strong>simulation</strong> with time controls and <strong>active pause</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1761745260\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Build power-lines at your own pace and rearrange resources on the fly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1761745260\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Place and upgrade defense towers to zap more starclops with a single shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1761745260\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Upgrade power stations to charge your towers faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1761745260\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Strategically choose rewards each week to replenish your resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"